Need parse words. Coefficients:
```
const coeff = new Map();
const addCoeff = (word, sign) => {
  for (let i=0; i<word.length; i++) {
    const ch = word[i];
    const place = 10n ** BigInt(word.length - 1 - i);
    coeff.set(ch, (coeff.get(ch) || 0n) + sign * place);
