Exercism book-store Python common solution:
```
def total(basket):
    counts = [basket.count(i) for i in range(1,6)]
    counts.sort(reverse=True)
    total = 0
    while any(counts):
        if counts[4] > 0:
            total += 3000
            counts = [c-1 for c in counts]
        elif counts[3] > 0:
            total += 2560
            counts = [c-1 for c in counts[:4]] + [0]
        elif counts[2] > 0:
            total += 2160
            counts = [c-1 for c in counts[:3]] + [0,0]
        elif counts[1] > 0:
            total += 1520
            counts = [c-1 for c in counts[:2]] + [0,0,0]
        else:
            total += 800
            counts[0] -= 1
    return total
```
