Rule R:
Sort counts descending a>=b>=c>=d>=e.
If e == 0: take group of size p = number of positive counts (1..4) (decrement all positive).
Else if c > d: take group of size 4, decrement a,b,c,d (omit e).
Else: take group of size 5, decrement all.
Add price[size]. Repeat.

