Pseudo:
```
private int parseDefinition(List<String> input, int i) {
    if (i + 2 >= input.size()) throw invalid; // need at least : name ;
    String name = input.get(i+1).toLowerCase(Locale.ROOT);
    if (isNumber(name) || name.isEmpty() || name.equals(":") || name.equals(";")) throw invalid;
    int j = i+2;
    List<String> body = new ArrayList<>();
    while (j < input.size()) {
        String t = input.get(j).toLowerCase(Locale.ROOT);
        if (t.equals(";")) {
            definitions.put(name, body);
            return j+1;
        }
        body.add(t);
        j++;
    }
    throw invalid;
}
```
